---
title: "publishTgeDetails (LegionPreLiquidApprovedSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_auth: publishTgeDetails(askTokenAddr, totalSupply, allocatedTokens)
    q_check_auth --> q_check_ended: caller is Legion operator
    q_check_auth --> q_revert_auth: unauthorized
    q_check_ended --> q_check_tge: hasEnded == true
    q_check_ended --> q_revert_not_ended: sale not concluded
    q_check_tge --> q_set_token: TGE completed (token deployed)
    q_check_tge --> q_revert_tge: TGE not complete
    q_set_token --> q_set_alloc: askToken = askTokenAddr
    q_set_alloc --> q_emit: totalAllocatedTokens = allocatedTokens
    q_emit --> [*]: emit TgeDetailsPublished(askToken, totalSupply, allocatedTokens)
    q_revert_auth --> [*]: revert UnauthorizedAccess
    q_revert_not_ended --> [*]: revert SaleNotConcluded
    q_revert_tge --> [*]: revert TGENotComplete

    note right of q_set_token
        INV-001: askToken set only once during TGE publication
        INV-002: TGE details enable token supply and distribution stages
    end note
